            "text_position": "center",
            "top_image_width": 100,
            "text_color": "text-dark",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Trusted Grass Seed Supplier in Grand Junction, CO Since 1989",
            "text": "<p>Finding the right seed can be tough when you’re dealing with dry summers, high elevations, or patchy ground that just won’t fill in. That’s why we put together a collection of grass seed that actually works for the soil, sun, and moisture conditions here in Grand Junction, CO.</p><p>Rivendell Distribution is a family-owned business that got its start with bluegrass sod and now supplies seed mixes that are proven to grow strong across Western Colorado. We carry everything from cool-season grasses for a healthy lawn to<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Pasture+Grass\" target=\"_blank\"> pasture mixes</a> that offer fair regrowth and palatable spring forage for your animals. You’ll also find<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Native+Grass\" target=\"_blank\"> native see</a>d,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Turf+Grass\" target=\"_blank\"> turf grass</a>, and<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Wildflowers+%26+Grass+Seed\" target=\"_blank\"> wildflower blends</a> ideal for erosion control, bare spots, and tough planting areas on slopes or construction sites.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary btn--small",
            "bg_color": ""
          }
        }
